Phase 6 continuation 2026-10-09. The pinned Java checkout remains read-only at commit efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9.
Route decimal input audit: commits 96e29d2 and 27366c2 add ten `TopicQueueMappingInfo.epoch` Long-boundary inputs and one high-precision `currIdMap` decimal input. Java decimal/exponent conversions truncate and wrap through BigDecimal low-bit semantics; overflowing integer tokens still reject. The `currIdMap` cases establish 9223372036854775807.0→-1, 2147483648.0→-2147483648, and -2147483649.0→2147483647. The native differential reproduced f64 rounding mismatches before fix e39abf5. The route DTO fixture now has 77 inputs at SHA-256 d53061010582605048578e1d4d7a794764ce5be14a4616cd9c1db72e1a17b725.
Heartbeat decimal input audit: probe/test commit 51191e9 adds four actual Java cases, expanding heartbeat DTO input coverage from 43 to 47. Isolated codeSet decimal values 9223372036854775807.0, 9223372036854775808.0, and -9223372036854775809.0 yield -1, 0, and -1; the combined set is [-1, 0]. The differential reproduced the f64 mismatch before the same RawValue decoder fix e39abf5. The heartbeat fixture SHA-256 is 387338054f1043053dbeebc14a3dc20893ac450dce19ce5dfebb99657bd7c412.
Implementation e39abf5 enables serde_json raw_value and retains numeric lexemes for scalar i32/i64 fields, numeric map values, and nullable integer-set members. Decimal/exponent inputs truncate and narrow to Java low bits; plain integer range rejection and the observed object/null behavior remain covered.
Validation passed: heartbeat and route focused DTO differentials; full `cargo test --workspace --all-targets --locked --quiet` (exit 0); `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features --locked -- -D warnings`; `cargo fmt --all -- --check`; `git diff --check`; pinned offline Maven verify (22 scenarios and deterministic fixture checks); `python3 tests/differential/compare.py --self-test`.
Updated ADR-0014, ADR-0015, Java 5.5.1 compatibility evidence, Phase 6 API/config, requirement, runtime, and heartbeat audit documents. No plan or pinned Java source checkout was modified; no Broker/Docker was used. Phase 6 remains incomplete and P6-V04 stays PENDING_PHASE_19.
